            "content": "# Part `guide` (6 of 6): checks G4-G7, J3 and J4: the new Orchestrator field guide (approval item 30)\n\nThe commission is the frozen bar below (custody/bar.md, sha256 72e92dc7580e2447f19dfff66aaac02d8484157a6283dcfdda6c7bb2de7561c6). This request covers only the part named above; the parts, in order, are `ledger`, `emitter`, `verifier`, `edi`, `docs`, `guide`. Allowed paths for this part: docs/PLUMBLINE-ORCHESTRATOR-FIELD-GUIDE.md (new; the only file of this request).\n\n## Frozen bar: allow-list (verbatim)\n\n## Allow-list (spec)\n- **Edit:** `kit/custody_ledger.py`, `kit/emit_custody.py`, `kit/custody_history.py`, `kit/plumbline_job.py` (only to pass `--allow-hand-times` through to the emitter at close, and to run the verifier at close and refuse on failure; V8), `tests/validate_schemas.py`, `docs/custody-emission.md`, `kit/README.md`.\n- **New files only:**\n  - `tools/edi/**`;\n  - `kit/plumbline_verify.py` (V1–V9);\n  - `docs/PLUMBLINE-ORCHESTRATOR-FIELD-GUIDE.md` (item 30; the only file for that item);\n  - `schemas/x-plumbline/x-plumbline-v1.schema.json` (the only new file allowed under `schemas/`);\n  - `tests/test_edi_*.py`, `tests/test_custody_ledger*.py`, `tests/test_plumbline_verify*.py`;\n  - new folders under `tests/fixtures/custody/` (new planted or clean cases).\n- **Unchanged, byte for byte:**\n  - every file under `tests/fixtures/` at 3df1ce5;\n  - everything under `dot-plumbline/jobs/`;\n  - every file under `schemas/` at 3df1ce5 (15 files; derived or vendored, pinned by `tools/pin.json`), plus `gate/` and `standards/`;\n  - `tools/pin.json` and `tools/build_schemas.py`.\n- **Fixture-only and test-only fixes are not acceptable** (approval item 16). A fixture or test change never counts as the fix for a finding. The Orchestrator names the kind of fix in each generation-close line.\n\n## Frozen bar: Maker output contract (verbatim)\n\n## Maker output contract\n- Whole files, between `<<<PLUMBLINE-FILE path=<path>>>>` / `<<<P