with reconciliation an upper bound and no per-job-key recommendation; the cross-family pre-read optional, decided per job on the approval sheet), the item-30 (c) rules, and DOCTRINE.md v0.1 @ `dc61854` (copied verbatim, CC BY 4.0, into the frozen instrument): nothing in the guide contradicts them, and it does not claim to override the doctrine. [the evaluator's held-out controls for this check are omitted from the Maker prompt] | **E-GLM** | `evidence/J3-<call>.json` + harness log + generation reply |\n| J4 | **G-story.** Every rule from item 30 (b) and (c) that the guide states is paired with its real story (a concrete incident from a real job or review, placed with the rule), in field-guide style. A bare reason or a hypothetical is not a story. [the evaluator's held-out controls for this check are omitted from the Maker prompt] | **E-GLM** | `evidence/J4-<call>.json` + harness log + generation reply |\n\n## fg_rules.json (frozen; the exact anchors, normalization and denylist G5-G7 apply)\n\n```\n{\n  \"_status\": \"FROZEN-BUILD 2026-10-28T20:36:28Z — G4-G7 rules (published to the Maker), job 2026-10-28-custody-times-ledger-spend; sha256 in ../../MANIFEST.sha256. This key is ignored by the checks.\",\n  \"path\": \"docs/PLUMBLINE-ORCHESTRATOR-FIELD-GUIDE.md\",\n  \"normalize\": \"lowercase; drop the characters * _ ` and backslash; map curly quotes to straight and en/em dashes to '-'; collapse all whitespace to one space\",\n  \"status\": {\n    \"within_first_lines\": 15,\n    \"line_must_contain_all\": [\n      \"status\",\n      \"non-normative\",\n      \"doctrine wins\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"groups\": {\n    \"B1-tripwire\": [\n      [\n        \"same failure class\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"3 times\",\n        \"three times\",\n        \"third time\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"change the request\"\n      ]\n    ],\n    \"B2-shared-key\": [\n      [\n        \"shared key\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"spend guard\"\n      ],\n      [\n        \"upper bound